  "accentNotes": "Fill colours are used for ticks, progress, selection and buttons. Text colours meet WCAG AA (4.5:1) on the warm canvas and surface of each appearance (light #F8F4ED / #FFFDFA, dark #1B1A19 / #2B2927): coral text is #B74F38 in light mode (4.6:1 on the canvas) and #E87359 in dark mode (4.9:1 on cards). White text on a coral fill is only 3:1, so filled light-mode buttons use the text colour as their fill.",
